00:09:58.664 --> 00:09:59.498 size:81% position:41% line:92%
I remember, on Friday,

00:09:59.498 --> 00:10:01.400 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was rushing home
to be able to see them.

00:10:01.400 --> 00:10:04.537 size:88% position:44%
And I had to, you know,
on I-95, pull over twice

00:10:04.537 --> 00:10:05.338 size:84% position:42% line:92%
