00:10:05.338 --> 00:10:07.707 align:start size:94% position:6%
because I was just
so overwhelmed by emotion.

00:10:07.707 --> 00:10:11.777
And I drove straight to go
pick them up from their daycare,

00:10:11.777 --> 00:10:14.413 align:start size:94% position:6%
and my 5-year-old
came out first, Austin.

00:10:14.413 --> 00:10:18.351
And he gave me a big hug, an
he said, "Dadda, are you okay?

00:10:18.351 --> 00:10:22.054
with this really concerned voice
I hadn't heard him use before.

00:10:22.054 --> 00:10:25.491 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he said, "Did someone tr
to destroy your office?"

00:10:25.491 --> 00:10:27.293 align:start size:94% position:6%
