00:10:46.812 --> 00:10:48.881 line:92%
So, there's been a lot here.

00:10:48.881 --> 00:10:51.117 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I've honestly
really struggled,

00:10:51.117 --> 00:10:52.985 align:start size:94% position:6%
